:5},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"French","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cajun/Creole, French, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, French, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","review_id":"hZ6qdIbdqg5sCiZk6gfUbw","date":"2011-03-31T16:55:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9480832815170288,"text_excerpt":"A couple of friends took us here for lunch and we are so glad they did. It's been around since 1803, meaning they must be doing something right for over 200 years. We wanted to eat on the patio, which was about a 45 minute wait, but got a chance to grab some drinks in the bar and catch up. Cool bar. The bartenders were attentive, and entertaining. I grabbed an Abita Amber while the others got their drinks as well. We were seated pretty quickly after that. Started lunch with my first oyster shooter. I opted for the Cajun Aphrodisiac which included vodka and bloody mary mix. Not sure if that's a drink or an appetizer, but it was good. For lunch I got the Bayou Platter consisting of shrimp c..."},{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","review_id":"Ucx0h3SvV4hE363HBmAiWA","date":"2017-03-16T16:55:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9455437064170837,"text_excerpt":"We were so hungry when we passed by this restaurant. We ordered food that could probably feed 8 people- there were only 3 of us. As usual, we ordered charbroiled oysters, crawfish bisque, cajun shrimp, creamy crawfish pasta w crab cake and jambalaya. From the moment we got to New Orleans we pretty much ate the same things but at different places. This place would probably be my 2nd favorite just after Acme Oyster House. I loved the pasta!!! Another thing that we enjoyed is seeing how \"cajun\" is different from what we have in L.A. Their shrimp definitely didn't come in a bag drowning in sauce. It was delicious. Plenty of things listed on the menu so might get overwhelming. The only thing I..."},{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","review_id":"olhDb-Fc-HAusoWcDsQyNA","date":"2018-06-22T22:47:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409031867980957,"text_excerpt":"This place was really good. I just wanted a light dinner so I ordered a half pound shrimp with corn, sausage, and potatoes. It sounds like a lot, but it was just right lol. The seafood boil was seasoned just right and tasted great. I sat at the bar and just chatted with the bartender, Lionel, who was really cool and nice to talk to. My drinks were made just right and the atmosphere was pretty laid back. If you're near the market area I recommend this place. Good seafood at a decent price."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","photo_id":"sVNtT5B4yLLaGXMzuYuh2w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/sVNtT5B4yLLaGXMzuYuh2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8777827024459839},{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","photo_id":"OGE3iiq4cbS14bX69Y88Iw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OGE3iiq4cbS14bX69Y88Iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8670220971107483},{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","photo_id":"RLFwUKlz5SpCZ34tG9zZ0Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RLFwUKlz5SpCZ34tG9zZ0Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8327621221542358},{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","photo_id":"dVnahm8FFhtnKyVJAjQIbA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dVnahm8FFhtnKyVJAjQIbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8229667544364929},{"business_id":"9OCsSHr6OCSyR91BFIbszQ","photo_id":"Ij-rOBHhaJFya4PQiohfBg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ij-rOBHhaJFya4PQiohfBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.762394905090332}]},"notebook_case":null}
